# In production, the frontend is served by the same FastAPI process.
# API calls go to relative /api/... paths — no VITE_API_BASE needed.
# The code in api.js defaults to "" when this is unset, which is correct.
#
# Only set VITE_API_BASE if you're running the frontend against a REMOTE backend
# (e.g., local dev against the deployed Render backend).
# VITE_API_BASE=https://manak-mitra.onrender.com